{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Is $[4,2,0]^2$ really blind to $[5,4,3]$ and $[4,4,4]$?\n\n`L2-420-localization-EH.wb` (cell 14) reports that $\\mathrm{HW}_{[5,4,3]}$ and $\\mathrm{HW}_{[4,4,4]}$ lie entirely in the null space of the localized data. The test was site1+site2+$\\Omega$+$x_0$ rows for 20 $w$, at $\\varepsilon=10^{-6}$. This notebook checks that claim directly, using only one-site objects. Self-contained; the first code cell clears the (shared) kernel.\n\n**Why one-site objects suffice.**\n- In the frame with $R$ undone, a site-1-local insertion has covector $c=u\\otimes e_1^T$ with $u=\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|T^{L=1,\\theta_1}_\\lambda(\\theta_1-4h)\\,R^{-1}$. A site-2-local one has $c=e_1^T\\otimes u'$ with $u'=\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|X^{L=1,\\theta_2}R^{-1}$. These are the localization formulas of `L2-420-localization.md`, up to scalar factors.\n- For a HW vector $h$, $c\\cdot h=u\\cdot(1\\otimes e_1^T)h$. The slice $(1\\otimes e_1^T)h$ is never zero: the largest site-2 weight occurring in $h$ must be the site-2 highest weight. Its site-1 weight is $\\mu-\\Lambda$.\n- So $c\\cdot h\\neq0$ for some $h\\in\\mathrm{HW}_\\mu$ iff $u$ has a component, along the slices, in site-1 weight $\\mu-\\Lambda$. That weight is $(1,2,3)$ for $[5,4,3]$ and $(0,2,4)$ for $[4,4,4]$.\n\n**Cells.**\n1. Setup.\n2. The weight support of every localized $u$.\n3. The direct overlaps $c\\cdot h$ with the HW vectors of $[5,4,3]$ and $[4,4,4]$, at a finite twist and at small $\\varepsilon$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll @@ Select[Names[\"Global`*\"], FreeQ[Attributes[#], Protected] &];\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nΛ = {4, 2, 0}; d1 = dim[Λ]; id1 = IdentityMatrix[d1]; pr = 60;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5};\nMsolEH = Module[{Mv = Array[mm, d1]}, Mv /. First[Solve[Join[Thread[DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[DiagonalMatrix[Mv] . JJ[j, i, Λ] - Transpose[JJ[i, j, Λ]] . DiagonalMatrix[Mv], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]], 0] == 0], {mm[1] == 1}], Mv]]];\nRd = Sqrt[MsolEH];\nEN[i_, j_] := EN[i, j] = N[DiagonalMatrix[Rd] . JJ[i, j, Λ] . DiagonalMatrix[1/Rd], pr];\nwt1 = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1];\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 8}];\n(* one-site chain at site s, twist M on the right; t_a and CBR T_λ as before *)\nlax1[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - thN[[s]]) id1 + hN EN[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ntwistR[T_, M_] := Table[Sum[T[[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ntq[mono_, a_, x_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[mono[x - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], rows[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[rows]}], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntL1[s_, a_, x_, M_] := tq[twistR[lax1[s, #], M] &, a, x];\nconj[λ_] := Table[Count[λ, y_ /; y >= j], {j, Max[λ]}];\nTL1[s_, λ_, x_, M_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]},\n     If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0, Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[If[as[[i]] == 0, id1, tL1[s, as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hN, M]], {i, n}]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\nrOm[zv_, wv_] := {(wv[[1]] - zv[[1]])/(wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[1]]) (zv[[1]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (wv[[2]] - zv[[3]])),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (zv[[3]] - wv[[2]]))};\nRrot[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, nexp[r[[1]] EN[1, 2]] . nexp[r[[2]] EN[1, 3]] . nexp[r[[3]] EN[2, 3]]];\nRrotInv[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, nexp[-r[[3]] EN[2, 3]] . nexp[-r[[2]] EN[1, 3]] . nexp[-r[[1]] EN[1, 2]]];\nOm1[zv_, wv_] := e1 . Rrot[zv, wv];\n(* the localized one-site vectors u (R undone): site 1 at θ1-4h; site 2 t2(θ2+h) and T_(2,2)(θ2) *)\nuSite1[λ_, zv_, wv_] := (Om1[zv, wv] . TL1[1, λ, thN[[1]] - 4 hN, DiagonalMatrix[zv]]) . RrotInv[zv, wv];\nuSite2[zv_, wv_] := {(Om1[zv, wv] . tL1[2, 2, thN[[2]] + hN, DiagonalMatrix[zv]]) . RrotInv[zv, wv], (Om1[zv, wv] . TL1[2, {2, 2}, thN[[2]], DiagonalMatrix[zv]]) . RrotInv[zv, wv]};\nshapes1 = {{1, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 2}, {4, 2}};\nzT = N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]; wT = N[{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, pr];\nGrid[{{\"Λ, dim\", {Λ, d1}}, {\"weights of the 27 (distinct)\", Length[Union[wt1]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"34\" data-out-n=\"366\" data-sub-idx=\"31\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"39\" data-sub-end=\"39\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[366]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHskXExhbWJkYSQsIGRpbX0gJiBcbGVmdFx7XGxlZnRcezQsMiwwXHJpZ2h0XH0sMjdccmlnaHRcfVxcXGhsaW5lXHRleHR7d2VpZ2h0cyBvZiB0aGUgMjcgKGRpc3RpbmN0KX0gJiAxOVxcXGhsaW5lXGVuZHthcnJheX0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ, dim</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weights of the 27 (distinct)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">19</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
