  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 1. weight support of each localized u: norm of its components in each site-1 weight, at the finite test twist and at ε = 10^-4 *)\nφ = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; ω = {3/4, -1/5, 2/9};\nuAll[zv_, wv_] := Join[Table[uSite1[λ, zv, wv], {λ, shapes1}], uSite2[zv, wv]];\nuLabels = Join[(\"site1 T\" <> ToString[#] &) /@ shapes1, {\"site2 t2(θ2+h)\", \"site2 T(2,2)(θ2)\"}];\nwts1 = Reverse[Sort[Union[wt1]]];\nsupp[us_] := Table[With[{idx = Flatten[Position[wt1, ν]]}, Table[With[{n = Norm[u[[idx]]]/Norm[u]}, If[n < 10^-40, 0, N[n, 2]]], {u, us}]], {ν, wts1}];\n{tSup, {sF, sE}} = AbsoluteTiming[{supp[uAll[zT, wT]], supp[uAll[N[Exp[10^-4 φ], pr], N[Exp[10^-4 ω], pr]]]}];\nGrid[Join[{Join[{\"site weight ν\", \"mult\"}, uLabels]}, Table[Join[{wts1[[i]], Count[wt1, wts1[[i]]]}, Table[Row[{sF[[i, j]], \" | \", sE[[i, j]]}], {j, Length[uLabels]}]], {i, Length[wts1]}],\n   {{\"(entries: finite twist | ε = 10^-4, relative norm)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", tSup}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
