  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 2. direct overlaps c·h for h in HW_[5,4,3] and HW_[4,4,4] of [4,2,0]⊗[4,2,0]; site-1 c = u⊗e1, site-2 c = e1⊗u' *)\nEtot[i_, j_] := Etot[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[EN[i, j]], SparseArray[id1]] + KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[id1], SparseArray[EN[i, j]]];\nwt2 = Flatten[Table[a + b, {a, wt1}, {b, wt1}], 1];\nhwB[μ_] := hwB[μ] = With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wt2, μ]]}, Orthogonalize[Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> n], {d1^2}]], {n, NullSpace[Normal[Join[Etot[1, 2][[All, sec]], Etot[2, 3][[All, sec]]]]]}]]];\nslice2[h_] := Partition[h, d1][[All, 1]];   (* (1⊗e1^T) h : site-2 component along e1 *)\nslice1[h_] := Partition[h, d1][[1]];        (* (e1^T⊗1) h : site-1 component along e1 *)\novl[zv_, wv_, μ_] := With[{H = hwB[μ], us = uAll[zv, wv]}, Join[Table[us[[j]] . slice2[#] & /@ H, {j, Length[shapes1]}], Table[us[[j]] . slice1[#] & /@ H, {j, Length[shapes1] + 1, Length[us]}]]];\n{tO, ovTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{μ, Length[hwB[μ]], N[Min[Norm /@ (slice2 /@ hwB[μ])], 3],\n     N[Map[Norm, ovl[zT, wT, μ]], 3], N[Map[Norm, ovl[N[Exp[10^-4 φ], pr], N[Exp[10^-4 ω], pr], μ]], 3]}, {μ, {{5, 4, 3}, {4, 4, 4}, {6, 4, 2}}}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"mult\", \"min ‖slice‖ (nonzero = lemma)\", \"‖c·h‖ per localized u, finite twist\", \"same, ε = 10^-4\"}}, ovTab, {{\"time (s)\", tO, \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
